---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'How to Set Up Alipay as a Foreigner (2026): Step-by-Step Guide';
const description = 'Step-by-step guide to setting up Alipay as a foreigner in China. Download, register with international number, verify identity, and link your foreign credit card.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/payment/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Payment
      </a>
    </nav>
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">💳 支付</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Set Up Alipay as a Foreigner (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">大约需要15分钟，具体方法如下。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读5分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">--填写您的签证申请</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>下载支付宝，用您的国际电话号码注册，用护照验证您的身份，并链接您的外国Visa/Mastercard。</strong> No Chinese bank account or phone number needed. Takes about 15 minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Let me walk you through this. I've done it myself and helped about a dozen friends do the same. <strong>大约需要15分钟</strong>, and you can do the whole thing before you even board your flight.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📱</span> Step 1: Download the App
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Go to your app store and search for <strong>“支付宝”</strong>. The developer is "Alipay (Hangzhou) Technology Co., Ltd." — that's the real one. There are some fakes out there so double-check.
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>网间网操作系统：</strong> App Store</li>
        <li><strong>安卓：</strong> Google Play</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Your phone needs iOS 12+ or Android 8+. If your phone is more than 5–6 years old, you might run into issues.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">📞</span> Step 2: Register with Your Phone Number
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Open the app and tap "Sign Up." You'll be asked for your phone number. The good news: <strong>你可以使用自己的国际电话号码。</strong> Pick your country code from the dropdown (United States is +1, UK is +44, etc.), enter your number, and they'll send you a verification code via SMS.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🛂</span> Step 3: Verify Your Identity
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-5 rounded-r-xl mb-6 not-prose">
        <p class="text-yellow-900"><strong>这是最重要的一步。</strong> Without ID verification, you can't use Alipay for payments.</p>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        How it works:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li>Go to <strong>账户→ 身份验证</strong></li>
        <li>Select <strong>“外国护照”</strong> as your ID type</li>
        <li>为您的护照照片页拍一张清晰的照片</li>
        <li>自拍（他们会把它和你的护照照片进行比较）</li>
        <li>验证通常在几分钟内或最多24小时内完成</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Make sure your passport photo page is well-lit and all text is readable. Blurry photos are the most common reason for verification failures.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">💳</span> Step 4: Link Your Foreign Credit Card
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Go to <strong>卡片→ 添加卡片</strong>. You can link any of the following:
      </p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <li><strong>Visa</strong> — Widely accepted</li>
        <li><strong>来自国际银行。不幸的是，卡绑定可能不如支付宝一致。如果失败，请在24小时后重试或使用其他卡。</strong> — Widely accepted</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Enter your card number, expiry date, and CVV. Alipay typically does a small test charge (¥0.01–¥1.00) to verify the card. This charge is refunded automatically.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">✅</span> You're All Set!
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        That's it. You can now use Alipay to pay at millions of merchants across China. When you're at a store, open the app, tap <strong>“付款”</strong>, and scan the merchant's QR code.
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        For metro and bus travel, you can also set up the <strong>运输二维码</strong> inside Alipay directly. Need help? Check the full payment overview for more details.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">支付宝、微信支付以及一切与金钱有关的东西</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">主要机场的交通选择</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">外国人如何设置微信支付</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">你可以在中国使用外国信用卡吗？</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">付款失败时该怎么办</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">故障排除指南</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sources -->
    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">VPN服务经常发生变化。没有单一的官方消息来源。在旅行前研究当前的建议。</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="https://www.alipayplus.com/consumer/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 underline text-sm">支付宝-消费者中心</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>